      "start_seconds": 38.34,
      "end_seconds": 48.33,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.32,
      "end_seconds": 68.27,
      "duration_seconds": 18.95,
      "text": "It's, It's all the time. I'd give it a seven, out of ten. Oh, you know, and headaches most days. About headaches most days, I'd give it a three, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
