      "text": "I've got an irregular heartbeat"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.59,
      "end_seconds": 140.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "Okay, I can see migraines and an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. A A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.61,
      "end_seconds": 154.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.05,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I work in accounts at a hospital. Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.43,
      "end_seconds": 159.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "right any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.29,
      "end_seconds": 165.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "um, no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.26,
      "end_seconds": 178.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.54,
      "end_seconds": 186.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "hmm, I'm allergic to nickel, I get a rash on my skin"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.58,
      "end_seconds": 191.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
