      "start_seconds": 242.19,
      "end_seconds": 243.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.01,
      "end_seconds": 248.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "now I'm gonna do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.16,
      "end_seconds": 250.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.24,
      "end_seconds": 268.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Your neurological examination is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.11,
      "end_seconds": 285.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.47,
      "text": "thank you you can get dressed. Having listened and examined I think we're dealing with medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine at this stage. We shouldn't forget tension-type headache"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.39,
      "end_seconds": 291.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "uh, you know, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.85,
      "end_seconds": 315.02,
      "duration_seconds": 21.17,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine, and we'll know more once the a headache diary is back. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had taking painkillers every day, and no visual changes or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.35,
      "end_seconds": 318.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Mm, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.24,
      "end_seconds": 325.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "I think a headache diary makes sense here, for daily headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.7,
      "end_seconds": 329.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.54,
      "end_seconds": 363.91,
      "duration_seconds": 33.37,
      "text": "You'll be taking amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. You take it by mouth. That's for headache prevention. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Stop the daily painkillers gradually, the headaches may worsen for a couple of weeks first. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.25,
      "end_seconds": 368.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I know what to watch for"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.54,
      "end_seconds": 373.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.96,
      "end_seconds": 378.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Mm I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
